{"seq":2,"slug":"derivatives-pricing","title":"衍生品定价","stage":"DONE","category":"quantitative-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing","rating":{"composite":3.75,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"衍生品定价\">衍生品定价</h1><p>衍生品定价是量化金融的核心领域，研究如何为期权、期货、互换等金融衍生工具确定合理的理论价格。从 1973 年 Black-Scholes 公式的发表到当今的随机波动率模型与机器学习定价方法，衍生品定价理论经历了半个世纪的深刻演进，始终是连接数学、统计学与金融实务的关键纽带。</p>\n<p>本 Hub 系统性地梳理衍生品定价的理论基础、经典模型、数值方法与前沿进展。从无套利原理和风险中性测度出发，经过随机微积分与 Black-Scholes 框架，延伸到欧式/美式/奇异期权的定价实践；在数值方法层面涵盖蒙特卡洛模拟、有限差分和树/格子模型；最后深入随机波动率模型（Heston、SABR）、利率模型（HJM、LMM）以及信用衍生品（CDS、CDO）的高级定价技术。</p>\n<p>全部内容兼顾数学推导的严谨性与 Python 代码实现的可操作性，帮助读者从理论到实践完整掌握衍生品定价的核心方法论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节导航\">章节导航</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 定价理论基础</td>\n<td>数学基础与经典模型</td>\n<td>无套利原理、随机微积分、Black-Scholes 模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 期权定价</td>\n<td>各类期权的定价方法</td>\n<td>欧式/美式期权、奇异期权、波动率曲面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 数值方法</td>\n<td>计算定价的数值技术</td>\n<td>蒙特卡洛模拟、有限差分、树模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 高级模型</td>\n<td>前沿定价模型</td>\n<td>随机波动率、利率模型、信用衍生品</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pricing-foundations","title":"定价理论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/pricing-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"no-arbitrage-principle","title":"无套利原理与风险中性定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/pricing-foundations/no-arbitrage-principle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stochastic-calculus","title":"随机微积分基础：布朗运动与伊藤引理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/pricing-foundations/stochastic-calculus"},{"seq":3,"slug":"black-scholes-model","title":"Black-Scholes 模型与解析解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/pricing-foundations/black-scholes-model"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"options-pricing","title":"期权定价","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/options-pricing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"european-american-options","title":"欧式与美式期权定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/options-pricing/european-american-options"},{"seq":2,"slug":"exotic-options","title":"奇异期权定价方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/options-pricing/exotic-options"},{"seq":3,"slug":"volatility-surface","title":"波动率曲面与微笑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/options-pricing/volatility-surface"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"numerical-methods","title":"数值方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/numerical-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monte-carlo-methods","title":"蒙特卡洛模拟定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/numerical-methods/monte-carlo-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"finite-difference","title":"有限差分方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/numerical-methods/finite-difference"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tree-lattice-models","title":"树模型与格子方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/numerical-methods/tree-lattice-models"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced-models","title":"高级模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/advanced-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stochastic-volatility","title":"随机波动率模型：Heston 与 SABR","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/advanced-models/stochastic-volatility"},{"seq":2,"slug":"interest-rate-models","title":"利率模型与固定收益定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/advanced-models/interest-rate-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"credit-derivatives","title":"信用衍生品与违约模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/advanced-models/credit-derivatives"}]}]}